caption: Accounts and Benefits

Speaking of getting paid: Starbucks is a bank, so all of your pay is just automatically deposited in your account. No fuss, no fees! And don’t forget the other benefits, like access to the Starbucks Armory (once you complete your first mission), Guilds (at C rank), and preferred travel means (B rank). If you have any questions, reach out to your Mission Handler; they are your main point of contact for all information, promotions, and extras!
